'''Firewalker Boots''' are a [[footwear]] item in Stardew Valley. They can be obtained from the chest at floor 80 of [[The Mines]], found in [[Fishing#Treasure Chests|Fishing Treasure Chests]] after reaching [[Fishing#Fishing Skill|Fishing level 2]], or purchased from the [[Adventurer's Guild]] for {{Price|2000}} after reaching floor 80 of The Mines.

==History==
{{History|1.4|Added the possibility to be purchased in the [[Adventurer's Guild]] after reaching floor 80 of [[the Mines]].}}

